Z||000008||007DOUG||10-09-2000||04:56 PM||||Show below before the spindles were added. Thats 2 1/2" springs in the front, and 1 1/2" in the rear. Looks awesome, but oh that ride....brings back nightmares. Not to mention the front tires I chewed up REALLY quick. The shop just couldn'r get it lined up. <P>The spindles raised the car about 1" in the front.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/coolse.jpg"> <P>William:<BR>  The PRICE I paid for those spindles nearly killed me. They were from ebay, and I had to fight for them.<P>   I've called belltech about making another run, and they are in no way interested, nor do they care to ever produce them again. I think Rodney Dickman tried too. I'll let you know if I ever find another set. Keep trying swapmeets.<BR>||||reg||1
